  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "What is the area of a circular dinner plate given that its radius is $8\\,\\text{cm}?$",
  "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14200665/assets/7223cab003af57279fc16d8044bd9eae6dbfa6bbfe41433b851ebdafd52e91da.png)\n\n \n\nThe area of the dinner plate  is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\pi {r}^{2} \\\\  & =\\pi \\cdot {8}^{2} \\\\  & =64\\pi \\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
